{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-reasonable-decent}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3fbe60b099a0a26de7b6125bbb37999f0e97ebb330f8ba1af544b026788a3afb", "source_text": "Decent algebraic stacks", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a68ceb79a208fcc877d72417f26e9113224eabb0efde6315fdc8f48e8d8fd526", "unit_id": "tag:0GW0:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{decent-spaces-section-reasonable-decent}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a65c6e820d2b475eb94a1924929bd2a074400409d6b08371071dc5f6fce5740a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis section is the analogue of\nDecent Spaces, Section <REF_0001>.\nIn particular, the following definition is compatible with\nthe notion of a decent algebraic space defined there.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:82b54977cc8be11e7f0de7e3557693821bcb06fc192e813b1259395cb9075b94", "unit_id": "tag:0GW0:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-UR-quasi-compact-above-x}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-decent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0af8f4526f85ee97a7b93ba234d4280177f28e160da9b7dede3536576458855f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a5e223fd6b90d06c8e3bc667dee80eac744db1e0eb7d7e3540f82d00ce576f49", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>decent<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nif for every <MATH_0003> the equivalent conditions of\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0001> are satisfied.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4812439bb21f6ac5db9ad49f1bed27149e4ebf94b616c513481a08ef6555b57d", "unit_id": "tag:0GW1:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$x$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6cce8cd8f40dc93bc6c684375d5be5f3cdc44b972dfbfa67108f57bfdc85ad08", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:eaadced0a791ef9480cc563c718436261c2c5d5c90c4b4a1018552c309f067f9", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nSome people would rephrase this definition by saying that\nevery point of <MATH_0001> is quasi-compact.\nA slightly stronger condition would be to ask that any morphism\n<MATH_0002> in the equivalence class of <MATH_0003> is\nquasi-separated as well as quasi-compact.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c9926aaa2de08ee9418b72b6af8dfb13c03321c30ca339f65b78e228847d75c2", "unit_id": "tag:0GW0:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Delta : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-separated-decent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:78d08296e4b169487174d0eb9f60189c725accedf09f9127171515d23c1d5514", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cf00d493821cb2660d95ea9606286d184558c81f6b7236f8fb19d9b77362ec4e", "source_text": "A quasi-separated algebraic stack <MATH_0001> is decent.\nMore generally, if <MATH_0002>\nis quasi-compact, then <MATH_0003> is decent.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:93c558a179f4723d6fcb43c2e19b2d0887f2722b68f12e6cc095b2d29955ab0e", "unit_id": "tag:0GW2:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$f : T \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$T$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Delta$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nT \\times_{f, \\mathcal{X}, f'} T' =\n(T \\times T')\n\\times_{(f, f'), \\mathcal{X} \\times \\mathcal{X}, \\Delta}\n\\mathcal{X}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-compact-permanence}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1e82a289e3b0381c8ad95960832df3218e56675ec57df5098cb6c5436dd38f9e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:12cb63dcb98f4b2c2b778cf176c578c31ee488389cbd09b029ceb37db6c28444", "source_text": "Namely, if <MATH_0001> is quasi-separated, then\nany morphism <MATH_0002> whose source is a\nquasi-compact scheme <MATH_0003>, is quasi-compact, see\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nIf <MATH_0004> is on known to be quasi-compact, then one uses the\ndescription\n<MATH_0005>\nto prove this. Details omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:70f751143f4ef30d9a99e2bdc6c2052c43b95783e17a8cf74858305fbf6bca6e", "unit_id": "tag:0GW2:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0GW0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$Y$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-representable-decent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:00d35f4225742a2d59cba677d726f19140f3a495f3bb5da13ab27a8ba329ba43", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b21a3d16a3b527911d90e4019836c542a774dbc50e9861e7d69e84bfaf5f32e7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism\nof algebraic stacks. Assume <MATH_0002> is decent\nand <MATH_0003> is representable (by schemes) or <MATH_0004> is representable\nby algebraic spaces and quasi-separated.\nThen <MATH_0005> is decent.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ec93b61a8244223281a480f1988f7c20ce272033c7a82e768d7d1bf2a1b7a4f9", "unit_id": "tag:0GW3:statement"}
